itted top, black skinny pants, and dark-brown heeled knee-high boots.\n<Subject 2> is the soft golden sunset cloudscape environment, a sea of billowing clouds bathed in warm late-afternoon light with gentle haze and drifting wisps.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> performing a varied dance sequence on top of <Subject 2> across three shots in six seconds: flowing arm waves into a gliding pivot, a small leaping half-turn with arms spread, and a closing facial close-up as she tucks her hair back and smiles at the camera. No wide shot is used; framing stays at medium or closer throughout.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - her long wavy red hair, red lipstick, gold hoop earrings, dark-red leather trench coat, black top, black pants, and dark-brown heeled boots are all retained exactly as in <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the golden cloud sea with warm sunset lighting persists across all shots.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a cinematic, dreamlike fantasy style with warm golden-hour lighting and soft volumetric haze.\n[Shot 1] A medium shot frames <Subject 1> from the knees up, standing on the crest of a billowing cloud within <Subject 2>. Her dark-red leather trench coat and long wavy red hair move in the wind. She initiates the dance with a liquid arm-wave motion: her right arm rises first, then her left, her wrists and elbows rolling in a continuous wave that passes across her chest and opens outward. On the final beat she steps onto the toes of her dark-brown heeled boots and pivots a smooth single turn on her left foot, the coat's belted skirt and hem flaring and trailing the rotation while her boot toe skims the cloud surface and drags a soft wake of cloud wisps. The camera pushes in slowly through the movement.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the shot cuts to a medium-close shot framing her from the w